&lt;tr style="height: 20px"&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 203px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;調整後行使価格＝調整前行使価格×&lt;/p&gt;
